; Bounded research fixture; explicit feeds, retract height and tools.
units metric
offset 54
tool 1 dia 3 length 30
spindle cw rpm 2000
; Four peck-drilled holes.
drill at grid at x 10 y 10 width 10 height 10 pitch 10 depth 4 peck 2 retract 5 feed 60
; A spot drill with bottom dwell in seconds.
drill at x 15 y 15 depth 1 retract 5 feed 60 dwell 0.25
spindle off
